--- a/docs/control-protocol.md
+++ b/docs/control-protocol.md
@@ -777,3 +777,5 @@ retain custom collapse settings and Timeline visibility.
 ### Select the layer under the pointer
 
 Assign **Select Layer Under Cursor** in Keyboard Shortcuts to choose the topmost visible, pickable layer beneath the canvas pointer. Empty pixels and points outside the document leave the selection unchanged; dialogs, strokes and brush-resize gestures block it. The command follows zoom, pan, view rotation and horizontal flipping. Agents can invoke `ui.menu.invoke {"id":"layer.selectUnderCursor"}` after moving the screen pointer with `ui.move {"x": ..., "y": ...}`. The command has no default shortcut.
+
+Codex reference attachments: `ui.codexAI.references` accepts either `{references:[{name,data}]}` (base64 image bytes) or `{paths:[...]}`. Path reads always use the configured `automation_read` policy. Inspect `ui.inspect.codexAI.references` and `referenceLoading`; raw image payloads are not exposed. Existing control message size limits remain unchanged. Interactive composer drops use the same bounded image loader and do not open documents.
